usage: export_boundary_quadrature.py [-h] [--config CONFIG] --source-dir
                                     SOURCE_DIR --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR

Export a finite positive quadrature of accepted manufactured joint source
pieces. Read only hash-bound source/acceptance bytes. Query and input checks
precede the new pure polynomial/quadrature import. No source, RHS, assembly,
old window export or independent reference driver is imported or executed.

options:
